{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33676","headline":"朱坡 · 林宽","name":"朱坡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱坡坡上望，不似在秦京。\n渐觉溪山秀，更高鱼鸟情。\n夜吟禅子室，晓爨猎人铛。\n恃此偷佳赏，九衢蜩未鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}